# Frontend (`apps/web`)

Tokens: [docs/design/global.md](docs/design/global.md). Deps: `pnpm add` inside `apps/web` only — never hand-edit `package.json` or lockfiles.

## Naming

- Folders: `kebab-case` (`src/components/spend-list/`)
- Component files: `PascalCase` (`SpendRow.tsx`)
- Hooks: `useXyz.ts` in the resource folder (`src/hooks/health/use-health.ts`)
- Types/interfaces: `PascalCase`; props `FooProps`
- Functions/variables: `camelCase`

## Layout

```
src/app/                       main.tsx, App.tsx, index.css, typeset.css
src/pages/<feature-kebab>/     route pages (`pages/auth/LoginPage.tsx`)
src/api/client.ts              axios instance + interceptors
src/api/<resource>/<resource>.ts         HTTP functions
src/api/<resource>/<resource>.types.ts   request/response types
src/hooks/<resource>/          all hooks for that resource (`use-health.ts`, query-keys)
src/lib/                       query-client, cn/utils
src/components/ui/             shadcn
src/components/<feature-kebab>/PascalFile.tsx
```

Example: `src/api/health/health.ts` + `health.types.ts`, hooks in `src/hooks/health/`. Auth pages are UI-only; next: `src/api/auth/` + `src/hooks/auth/` when wiring.

No barrel `index.ts` in `api/` or `hooks/`. Import the file (`@/api/health/health`, `@/hooks/health/use-health`).

Import order: third-party → `@/` → styles.

## Type safety

- Types live next to the resource: `<resource>.types.ts` (hand-written until OpenAPI codegen).
- No `any`. Prefer `unknown` + checks. Optional chaining on nested data.
- FastAPI errors: `error.response?.data?.detail` (string), not `.message`.

## Server state

- All HTTP through `useQuery` / `useMutation`. Query keys are arrays (`queryKeys.health`).
- `enabled` for conditional fetch. Pass `signal` into axios.
- `isLoading` = first load only. `isFetching` = every run (use for later loaders).
- Mutations later: toast via `sonner`; invalidate related keys on success.
- Access token is in-memory (`getAccessToken` / `setAccessToken`). Refresh cookie is httpOnly.

## UI

- shadcn primitives + `cn()`. Lucide only. No raw hex — semantic tokens.
- Typed props. Extract `.map()` rows to subcomponents. Keys = ids, not indexes.
- Early returns. No `console.log` unless behind a debug flag.
- Do not define components inside components. Derive state in render, not effects.
- Do not sprinkle `useMemo` / `useCallback` on simple values.

## Git

Conventional commits (`feat`, `fix`, `chore`, …). GitLab issues as `#<n>`. Not `STAM-xxx`.
